Define the product and evidence transferred between mine, processor, transporter, and refiner (@mine-handoffs: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J", #source "../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA", #source "../sources/Hard-Rock-Miners-Handbook.lingua#r_18YBY5XX4TFS7ZQSKTQMW34EFA", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "Supplies-infrastructure-dependencies-and-restorable-operation.lingua#r_6668FR88NFFDAWCP560Y8370CS", #metals-and-metallurgical-production "../../../materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/feedstocks/Feed-characterization-mineral-scrap-and-intermediate.lingua#r_2ZDRP5ZC01VAT3METZXTN739KY") { r_4WQ464KMKXECT0MF2ASW2H6D4G
**Read:** [Usinas de Beneficiamento de Minérios do Brasil — CETEM](../sources/CETEM-Usinas-de-Beneficiamento.lingua#r_62ZD994C9YYXB1YDVFQST5B27J), a complete plant/product case and its customer/process context; [Tratamento de Minérios — CETEM, sixth edition](../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA), full product-quality, characterization, and balance material used; [Hard Rock Miner’s Handbook — Jack de la Vergne, fifth edition](../sources/Hard-Rock-Miners-Handbook.lingua#r_18YBY5XX4TFS7ZQSKTQMW34EFA), complete relevant transport, operating, and product-interface sections.

A mineral product is supplied with a quantity, composition/phase population, physical form, moisture, size distribution, impurities, and an evidence trail. Contained metal alone does not specify whether a customer can use it. Concentrate, direct-use aggregate, chemical feed, and high-purity raw material have different preparation and acceptance questions.

Trace the custody and sampling point, who measures which property, the time/support of the sample, and the basis of any accepted quantity or quality statement. Handling, blending, drying, oxidation, contamination, or loss during transport can change the delivered material. Preserve competing measurements and agreed methods rather than silently replacing one with the other.

Link a specification to the downstream process it protects: impurity chemistry, phase behavior, energy/reagent duty, emissions, recovery, or final product performance. A low bulk impurity concentration can remain important if its species or distribution affects later purification. Specialized metallurgy and industrial-feedstock trails develop those transformations in full.

**Work:** follow one complete mine-to-customer case. Construct dry/wet mass and constituent accounts across custody changes, reconstruct the relevant assay/sampling evidence, and explain a quality dispute or uncertainty. Compare an alternative preparation or transport arrangement on delivered usable material and total connected work. Identify the exact refining/processing knowledge needed next rather than assuming that a concentrate is already a finished engineering material.

**Continue:** [Trace the inputs and repair capabilities needed to sustain mining and processing](Supplies-infrastructure-dependencies-and-restorable-operation.lingua#r_6668FR88NFFDAWCP560Y8370CS).

